  no rounding mismatch to clip the artwork. The ratio 62:96 = 0.646 is the source's
  460:717.456 = 0.641 to within the dp rounding available.

  NEVER put the viewBox numbers in android:width/height: the widget rasterises these
  into bitmaps for RemoteViews, and a ~1000dp intrinsic size is rasterised at that
  size, which crashed the app on connect with
  "RemoteViews for widget update exceeds maximum bitmap memory usage
